### Mercado Livre API Testing

# ============================================================================
# IMPORTANT: Use the latest OAuth values from your .env
# ============================================================================
# The authorization code is one-time use and short-lived.
# For stable integrations, always persist the refresh_token too.
# ============================================================================
@baseUrl = http://localhost:3000
@clientId = {{$dotenv MERCADO_LIVRE_CLIENT_ID}}
@clientSecret = {{$dotenv MERCADO_LIVRE_CLIENT_SECRET}}
@redirectUri = {{$dotenv MERCADO_LIVRE_REDIRECT_URI}}
@accessToken = {{$dotenv MERCADO_LIVRE_ACCESS_TOKEN}}
@refreshToken = {{$dotenv MERCADO_LIVRE_REFRESH_TOKEN}}
@authCode = {{$dotenv MERCADO_LIVRE_CLIENT_CODE}}

### Get Mercado Livre authorization code
GET https://auth.mercadolivre.com.br/authorization?response_type=&client_id=YOUR_CLIENT_ID&redirect_uri=YOUR_REDIRECT_URI



# ============================================================================
# TEST 0A: Exchange authorization code for token
# ============================================================================
POST https://api.mercadolibre.com/oauth/token
Content-Type: application/x-www-form-urlencoded

grant_type=authorization_code&client_id={{clientId}}&client_secret={{clientSecret}}&code={{authCode}}&redirect_uri={{redirectUri}}

###

# ============================================================================
# TEST 0B: Refresh access token
# ============================================================================
POST https://api.mercadolibre.com/oauth/token
Content-Type: application/x-www-form-urlencoded

grant_type=refresh_token&client_id={{clientId}}&client_secret={{clientSecret}}&refresh_token={{refreshToken}}

###

# ============================================================================
# TEST 0C: Validate token owner
# ============================================================================
GET https://api.mercadolibre.com/users/me
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

# ============================================================================
# TEST 1: Health Check (Your App)
# ============================================================================
GET {{baseUrl}}/health

###

# ============================================================================
# TEST 2: Search Products
# ============================================================================
# Searches for products on Mercado Livre
# Query parameters:
#   - q: search term (required)
#   - limit: number of results (optional, default 50)
#   - offset: pagination offset (optional, default 0)
#   - sort: price_asc | price_desc | relevance (optional)
GET https://api.mercadolibre.com/sites/MLB/search?q=notebook&limit=10&offset=0&sort=price_asc
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

###

# ============================================================================
# TEST 3: Get Product by ID
# ============================================================================
# Replace MLB123456789 with an actual product ID from search results
GET https://api.mercadolibre.com/items/MLB123456789
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

###

# ============================================================================
# TEST 4: Get Seller Information
# ============================================================================
# Replace 123456 with an actual seller ID
GET https://api.mercadolibre.com/users/123456
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

###

# ============================================================================
# TEST 5: Get Authenticated User
# ============================================================================
# Get information about the authenticated user (yourself)
GET https://api.mercadolibre.com/users/me
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

###

# ============================================================================
# TEST 6: Get All Categories
# ============================================================================
# Get list of all product categories in Brazil (MLB)
GET https://api.mercadolibre.com/sites/MLB/categories
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

###

# ============================================================================
# TEST 7: Get Category Details
# ============================================================================
# Replace MLB5672 with an actual category ID
GET https://api.mercadolibre.com/categories/MLB5672
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

###

# ============================================================================
# TEST 8: Get Products by Category
# ============================================================================
# Replace MLB5672 with an actual category ID
GET https://api.mercadolibre.com/sites/MLB/search?category=MLB5672&limit=10&offset=0
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

###

# ============================================================================
# TEST 9: Get Seller Listings
# ============================================================================
# Replace 123456 with an actual seller ID
GET https://api.mercadolibre.com/sites/MLB/search?seller_id=123456&limit=10&offset=0
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

###

# ============================================================================
# EXAMPLE WORKFLOW
# ============================================================================
# 1. Run TEST 2 to search for products and get product IDs
# 2. Run TEST 3 with a real product ID from results
# 3. From product, get seller_id and run TEST 4
# 4. Run TEST 5 to verify authentication
# 5. Run TEST 6 to see categories
# 6. Run TEST 8 with a category ID to browse products

###

# ============================================================================
# USEFUL CATEGORY IDs in Brazil (MLB)
# ============================================================================
# MLB5672 - Electrônicos
# MLB1649 - Smartphones
# MLB1743 - Câmeras Digitais
# MLB1144 - Computadores
# MLB3937 - Livros, Revistas e Comics
# Run TEST 6 for complete list

###

# ============================================================================
# ERROR HANDLING REFERENCE
# ============================================================================
# 401 Unauthorized - Invalid or expired access token
# 403 Forbidden - Token belongs to another user/app, lacks permission for the
#                 resource, the seller account is not eligible, or the token is invalid
# 404 Not Found - Product, seller, or category doesn't exist
# 429 Too Many Requests - Rate limited (wait and retry)
# 500 Server Error - Mercado Livre server issue

###

